<?php authorizeAdmin($u); ?>
<p class="page-intro">La jornada base es de 8 h 30 min. Los horarios temporales tienen vigencia y las solicitudes guardan las franjas usadas en su cálculo.</p><div class="detail-columns"><div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><h2>Jornada ordinaria</h2></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Días</th><th>Mañana</th><th>Tarde</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Lunes a jueves</td><td>07:30 – 12:00</td><td>13:00 – 17:00</td></tr><tr><td>Viernes</td><td>07:00 – 12:00</td><td>12:30 – 16:00</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="panel form-panel"><h2>Registrar horario temporal</h2><form method="post"><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="schedule"><label>Nombre o referencia<input name="name" required maxlength="180" placeholder="Ej. Extensión temporal de jornada"></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Desde<input name="start_date" type="date" min="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>" required></label><label>Hasta<input name="end_date" type="date" min="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>" required></label></div><p class="fine">Incluye la jornada completa de cada día. La tercera franja es opcional y permite registrar una extensión.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Día</th><th>Franja 1</th><th>Franja 2</th><th>Extensión</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach([1=>'Lunes',2=>'Martes',3=>'Miércoles',4=>'Jueves',5=>'Viernes'] as $day=>$label): ?><tr><td><?=e($label)?></td><?php for($i=0;$i<3;$i++): ?><td><input aria-label="<?=e($label)?> inicio franja <?=$i+1?>" name="periods[<?=$day?>][<?=$i?>][0]" type="time" value="<?=$i===0?($day===5?'07:00':'07:30'):($i===1?($day===5?'12:30':'13:00'):'')?>"><input aria-label="<?=e($label)?> fin franja <?=$i+1?>" name="periods[<?=$day?>][<?=$i?>][1]" type="time" value="<?=$i===0?'12:00':($i===1?($day===5?'16:00':'17:00'):'')?>"></td><?php endfor; ?></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><button class="button">Registrar vigencia</button></form></section><section class="panel form-panel"><h2>Vigencias registradas</h2><?php foreach(rows('SELECT * FROM schedules ORDER BY start_date DESC') as $s): ?><p><strong><?=e($s['name'])?></strong><br><?=e($s['start_date'].' a '.$s['end_date'])?></p><?php endforeach; ?></section></div>
<aside><section class="panel form-panel"><h2>Agregar día no laborable</h2><form method="post"><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="holiday"><label>Fecha<input name="date" type="date" min="<?=date('Y-m-d')?>" required></label><label>Nombre o referencia<input name="name" required maxlength="180"></label><button class="button secondary">Guardar día</button></form></section><section class="panel form-panel"><h2>Festivos y días no laborables</h2><p class="fine">Calendario nacional precargado. Revisa y agrega disposiciones municipales cuando corresponda.</p><ul class="plain-list"><?php foreach(rows('SELECT * FROM holidays WHERE date>=? ORDER BY date',[date('Y-m-d')]) as $h): ?><li><strong><?=e($h['date'])?></strong><span><?=e($h['name'])?></span><form method="post"><?=csrf()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="delete_holiday"><input type="hidden" name="date" value="<?=e($h['date'])?>"><button class="text-button" aria-label="Retirar <?=e($h['name'])?>">Retirar</button></form></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul></section></aside></div>
